title: Thief Fight + Egg/Canary/Bauble
story: dungeo
description: Give egg to thief at Treasure Room, kill thief, collect canary
  from opened egg, wind canary in forest for bauble. Restores from wt-12.

---

# Restore state from wt-12 (player at Living Room with torch and lantern)
$restore wt-12

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Drop everything except torch and lantern
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Lighten inventory for thief fight]

# Drop accumulated items from earlier walkthroughs (IF-gated since thief may have stolen some)
> drop blue cake

> drop eat-me cake

> drop sack

> inventory

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Get nasty knife from Attic
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Get nasty knife from Attic]

# Living Room → Kitchen → Attic
> east

> up

> take nasty knife

# Also grab volcano supplies while here (needed in wt-15)
> take brick

> take shiny wire

# Attic → Kitchen → Living Room
> down

> west

# Drop volcano supplies at Living Room for wt-15
> drop brick

> drop shiny wire

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Take egg from trophy case
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Take egg from trophy case]

> open trophy case

> take egg

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Navigate to Treasure Room and give egg to thief
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Give egg to thief at Treasure Room]

# Switch to lantern (thief may steal torch underground)
> turn on lantern

# Open trapdoor if needed
> open trap door

# Living Room → Cellar
> down

# Cellar → Troll Room (troll dead from wt-01)
> east

# Maze path (same as wt-03): S, E, W, UP, SW, E, S, NE → Cyclops Room
> south

> east

> west

> up

> southwest

> east

> south

> northeast

# Cyclops Room → Treasure Room (thief summoned by treasure-room-handler)
> up

# Give the egg to the thief
> give egg to thief

# Leave immediately so thief deposits at lair on his next turn (player absent)
> down

# Wait for thief to process lair deposit (opens egg, drops treasures)
> wait

> wait

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Kill the thief
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Kill the thief]

# Return to Treasure Room for the fight
> up

# Fight thief with nasty knife. Exact seed-42 sequence (pinned-seed
# counts, not padding — there is no loop or retry).
# RNG: the thief can disarm us; unarmed attacks are blocked ("Fighting
# unarmed is suicide.") so recover the knife before each swing.
# (loop region resolved to its seed-42 sequence — ADR-294 migration)
> attack thief with knife

# The disarm drops his stiletto (and he snatches the torch); "knife" is now
# ambiguous between the nasty knife and the nasty stiletto, so we finish him
# with his own blade. Seven blows is the seed-42 kill sequence.
> take stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

> attack thief with stiletto

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Collect canary from opened egg, egg, and chalice
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Collect canary, egg, and chalice]

# Drop knife if we still have it (thief may have stolen it during combat)
> drop knife

# Egg was opened by thief and dropped on floor. Canary is inside the open egg.
> take canary

> take egg

> take chalice

# Recover torch if thief stole it
> take torch

# The thief had also lifted the grail and the coins before wt-12 reached
# them — they scatter here with the rest of his loot (seed 42).
> take grail

> take bag of coins

# Break the frame to get the clue piece (ADR-078 canvas puzzle)
> break frame

> take frame piece

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Wind canary in forest for bauble
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Wind canary for bauble]

# Return to Living Room via Strange Passage
> down

> north

> east

# Navigate to forest (Living Room → Kitchen → Behind House → North of House → Forest Path)
> east

> east

> north

> north

# Wind the canary to summon songbird and get bauble
> wind canary

> take bauble

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Store treasures in trophy case]

# Return to Living Room (Forest Path → North of House → Behind House → Kitchen → Living Room)
> south

> east

> west

> west

> open trophy case

> put canary in trophy case

> put bauble in trophy case

> put chalice in trophy case

> put grail in trophy case

> put bag of coins in trophy case

> put egg in trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Recover stolen treasures from Treasure Room (thief's lair)
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Recover stolen treasures]

# Navigate to Treasure Room (Living Room → Cellar → Troll Room → maze → Cyclops Room → up)
> open trap door

> down

> east

> south

> east

> west

> up

> southwest

> east

> south

> northeast

> up

# Return to Living Room (Treasure Room → Cyclops Room → Strange Passage → Living Room)
> down

> north

> east

> open trophy case

[END GOAL]

# ============================================================================
# GOAL: Verify final state
# ============================================================================
[GOAL: Verify state for next segment]

# Drop frame piece at Living Room for wt-16 (canvas puzzle)
> drop frame piece

> inventory

> look

# Bank lantern battery: the lit torch is back in hand and wt-14 runs on it.
# (The lantern was only on as theft insurance during the thief fight.)
> turn off lantern

[END GOAL]

$save wt-13
